<p>Momino ro'o ke ye roz e gham o aafat hai <br>
ranj se zainab e bekas ki buri haalat hai<br>
Sar pe shabbar ke gira kohe gham o hasrat hai<br>
Qalq se haidar e karrar ki ab ruqsat hai</p>

<p>Uth gaya chain giraftaar e mehan hote hai<br>
Be pidar haye hussain aur hassan hote hai</p>

<p>Ab hai dushwaar yadullah ka sehat paana<br>
Hai pareshaan pisar choota hai aab o daana<br>
Kya qayamat hai musibat me yateemi aana<br>
Nahi do roz se khaya hai kisi ne khana</p>

<p>Muh ko chup chup ke pisar aansu'ou se dhote hai<br>
Dam badam zouf se behosh ali hote hai</p>

<p>Kya bayaa'n zainab o kulsoom ki howe haalat<br>
Dekhti jaati hai aa aake pidar ki surat<br>
Sehan me jaake dua karti hai baasad riqqat<br>
Ya quda dijiyo baba ko hamare sehat</p>

<p>Ham ghareebo ka nahi koi sahara ya rab<br>
Ab yahi chaahne wala hai hamara ya rab</p>

<p>Ghar me aa jate hai bahar se kabhi jo shabbir<br>
Dekh kar bhai ke muh ko hai ye kehti hamsheer<br>
Bhai jaan dekhte ho haal e shahe qaibar geer<br>
Kisi jarrah ko bulwaao karo kuch tadbeer</p>

<p>Mujh ko kuch ban nahi aata hai karu kya bhai<br>
Aankh bhi ab to nahi kholte baba bhai</p>

<p>Zaqm e sar dekh ke phat'taa hai kalejaa mera<br>
Qair allah kare dil hai dhadakta mera<br>
Ab jahaa'n me hai yahi chaahne wala mera<br>
Raas aaya na mujhe koofe me aana mera</p>

<p>Kis ko zaqm e sar e purnoor dikhaye zainab<br>
Kis se faryaad kare kis ko bulaaye zainab</p>

<p>Phir ye kehne lage fizza se shahe arsh nashee'n<br>
Aaj bachou ne mere khana bhi khaya ke nahi<br>
Jod kar hathou ko kehne lagi wo zaar o hazee'n<br>
Khana kaisa piya paani bhi nahi ya shahe dee'n</p>

<p>Na to khaate hai na shab ko ye zara sote hai<br>
Dekhte jaate hai haal aapka aur rote hai</p>

<p>Kaha shabbar se uthaao mujhe aye laal zara<br>
Baitha mai bhi hu tum khana mangaao beta<br>
Bole shabbir se paas aao mere maahe laqa<br>
Qushk lab dekh ke tere mujhe sadma hai bada</p>

<p>Yaad zahra ki waseeyat hai qalaq hota hai<br>
Tum jo bhooke ho kaleja mera shaq hota hai</p>

<p>Yaad ye waqeya tum ko bhi meri jaa'n hoga<br>
Naza ke waqt ye madar ne tumhari tha kaha<br>
Dhyaan yu to rahe har noor e nazar ka moula<br>
Mere shabbir ko par bhooka na rehne dena</p>

<p>Dard me mere hai is waqt ifaaqa beta<br>
Khana kha lo ke ho do roz se faaqa beta</p>

<p>Hai ghaneemat ke jo baithe hai koi dam milkar<br>
Khaalo do luqme mere hath se aye jaan e haidar<br>
Tum mere baad jo bhooke bhi rahoge dilbar<br>
Koi us waqt tumhari nahi lewega qabar</p>

<p>Bhooke pyase jo mere baad rahoge shabbir<br>
Yaad us waqt bohat hum ko karoge shabbir</p>

<p>Keh ke ye roye jo sheh aagaya ghash phir naagah<br>
Raat bhar ghash me karaaha kiye shaahe zeejaah<br>
Jab ke kuch subha ke aasar numaaya huwe aah<br>
Qalq se sher e quda uth gaye inna lillah</p>

<p>Hua andhyaara bujhi shamme imaamat hai hai<br>
Mar gaye waqt e sehar shaah e wilaayat hai hai</p>

<p>Aayi itne me waha zainab e zaaro naala'n<br>
Muh se sarka ke rida bole basad aah o fughaa'n<br>
Hum se muh mod ke hazrat to gaye suwe jinaa<br>
Kis ko sounpa hame farmaaiye ab baba jaa'n</p>

<p>Uth gaye dehr se sab chaahne wale humko<br>
Kar gaye haye pidar kis ke hawaale humko</p>

<p>Aap ke dam se tha amma ka meri ghar aabaad<br>
Hai ghazab ho gaye hai koofe me aakar barbaad<br>
Be pidar ho gaye be maa ke to the ham naashad<br>
Koun ab aayega karne ko hamari imdaad</p>

<p>Nana jaan margaye baba ka sahara na raha<br>
Zulm jo chaahe kare koi hamara na raha</p>

<p>Ab yateemou ki madad karne ko aayega koun<br>
Zulm se jor se ab haye bachayega koun<br>
Royenge shaam o sehar hum to manayega koun<br>
Pyaar se khana hame aah khilayega koun</p>

<p>Kyu na nazrou me jahaa'n ho meri kaala baba<br>
Koun zainab ka hai ab poochne wala baba</p>

<p>Ranj o andoh se hoga na safar aap ke baad<br>
Dukh pa dukh denge hame baaniye shar aapke baad<br>
Kuch to farmaaiye ham jaaye kidhar aap ke baad<br>
Kis tarha hogi yateemou ki basar aap ke baad</p>

<p>Uth gaya qalq se aaram hamara baba<br>
